workspace-hub (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public beta baseline.
  * Provide multi-workspace management and workspace-scoped section tabs.
  * Discover and launch local desktop, Flatpak, Snap and user applications.
  * Copy or move configured items between tabs and workspaces.
  * Preserve local data with serialised writes, restorepoints and fail-closed recovery.
  * Include English, Dutch and German interface support.

